{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30073","headline":"陈情上知己 · 刘得仁","name":"陈情上知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"性与才俱拙，名场迹甚微。\n久居颜亦厚，独立事多非。\n刻骨搜新句，无人悯白衣。\n明时自堪恋，不是不知机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}